I still feel suicide is my best option in an unbearable situation and as soon as I get out of here, I will carry out my plan. The majority of the public sympathized with Cindy, a woman who was let down in every way by systems that failed to protect her. Despite admissions to psychiatric units, she was repeatedly allowed to go home without receiving consistent treatment or diagnosis of her condition. If it was that the attacks were occurring to her, the police failed to catch a perpetrator who terrorized Cindy for more than seven years. One forensic psychiatrist who reviewed Cindy's extensive medical history and police files told the inquest, the tragedy is that with all these people involved, she wasn't saved. The inquest into the death of Cindy James was one of the most expensive and lengthy in British Columbia history. In the end, the jury failed to reach a conclusion as to whether Cindy had been murdered or had taken her own life.
我仍然觉得在无法忍受的处境下自杀是我最好的选择，一旦我离开这里，我就会执行我的计划。公众大多对辛迪报以同情，这是一个在各方面都被未能保护她的体制所辜负的女性。尽管曾多次入住精神病科病房，但她屡次被允许回家，却没有接受针对其病情的一致治疗或诊断。如果说袭击确实发生在她身上，警方却未能抓获那个恐吓辛迪七年多的凶手。一位审查了辛迪大量医疗记录和警方档案的法医精神病学家在研讯中表示，悲剧在于，尽管有这么多人参与其中，她却没有被拯救。对辛迪·詹姆斯死因的死因研讯是不列颠哥伦比亚省历史上最昂贵、历时最长的研讯之一。最终，陪审团未能就辛迪是被谋杀还是自杀得出结论。

87
01:31:43.000 --> 01:32:59.000
They determined that Cindy James died as the result of an unknown event after one vote shifted the decision from suicide to undetermined. Some thought that another person or persons were involved in the attacks orchestrated by Cindy. Others proposed that Cindy knew much more about the identity of the perpetrator than she told authorities. One factor that was not argued by nearly all who knew Cindy was that if she had indeed carried out the attacks upon herself, she was not aware that she was doing so. The terror in her eyes, the very real emotion she portrayed during countless interviews, convinced nearly all involved that Cindy truly believed these attacks were occurring to her. This lady suffered very deeply from within or out, one forensic psychiatrist stated. He suggested that Cindy cast herself on a stage as the victim in a fantastic plot of her own creation, adding, she was in a living nightmare.
他们确定辛迪·詹姆斯的死是由未知事件导致的，此前一票之差将决定从自杀改为了未定。一些人认为，另一个人或多个人参与了由辛迪策划的袭击。另一些人则提出，辛迪对袭击者的身份的了解远比她告诉当局的要多。几乎所有认识辛迪的人都一致认为的一个因素是，如果她确实对她自己实施了袭击，她并不知道自己正在这样做。她眼中的恐惧，她在无数次采访中表现出的极其真实的情感，说服了几乎所有参与者，让他们相信辛迪真的坚信这些袭击正在发生在她身上。一位法医精神病学家指出，这位女士内心或外部承受着极其深刻的痛苦。他暗示辛迪把自己塑造成自己创造的一个奇异情节中的受害者，并补充说，她生活在一场活生生的噩梦中。

88
01:32:59.000 --> 01:34:11.000
