To my dear sweet sister Cindy, it is always sunrise somewhere, the dew is never all dried at once, a shower is forever falling, vapour is forever rising. I hope that you feel the wonder of nature as I do, may it make you feel intensely alive and full of joy, now and forever. Thank you for watching. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
